# Security Rules

- Never commit API keys, tokens, or `.env` — use `.env.example` for templates.
- All project-scoped API routes must enforce ACL via dependency injection.
- LLM calls only from API/workers, never from browser client code.
- Validate and sanitize user prose storage; treat prompts as untrusted input for injection into agent templates with escaping.
- Rate-limit agent endpoints (Redis, Phase 2).
- Dependabot and secret scanning enabled via GitHub (repo settings).
